abstract: "ROI calculator for self-hosted LLM inference — models whether serving a 70B model on local GPUs pays off at a given per-minute rate, factoring VRAM, concurrent threads, utilization, hardware cost, and electricity. HTML/JS front end plus Python (NumPy, Matplotlib) break-even heatmaps."
